      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Data from exercise tolerance testing should be incorporated into clinical decision making. A strategy for stratification of individual patients into high, indeterminate, and low-risk categories using Bruce protocol exercise testing is outlined. This approach will help to ensure further evaluation of high-risk individuals without excessive testing of patients having excellent long-term prognoses."},
